#: cache.cpp:49
msgid "&Use cache"
msgstr "Gebruik kas"

#: cache.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Click here if you want the web pages you view to be stored on your hard disk "
"for quicker access. Enabling this feature will make browsing faster, since "
"the pages will only be downloaded as necessary. This is especially true if "
"you have a slow connection to the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hier as jy wil hê die web bladsye jy besigtig na wees gestoor op jou "
"hard disket vir vinniger toegang verkry. Aktiveer hierdie funksie sal maak "
"blaaiïng vinniger, sedert die bladsye sal slegs wees afgelaai as nodige. "
"hierdie is in besonder waar as jy het 'n stadige verbinding na die Internet."

#: cache.cpp:68 kcookiespolicies.cpp:154
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Beleid"

#: cache.cpp:83
msgid "&Keep cache in sync"
msgstr "Hou kas in sinkronisasie"

#: cache.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to verify whether the page cached in your hard disk "
"is still valid."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie as jy wil hê na bevestig hetsy die bladsy gekas in jou hard "
"disket is nogsteeds geldige."

#: cache.cpp:99
msgid "Use cache whenever &possible"
msgstr "Gebruik kas wanneer ook al moontlik"

#: cache.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Enable this to always use documents from the cache when available. You can "
"still use the reload button to synchronize the cache with the remote host."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie na altyd gebruik dokumente van die kas wanneer beskikbaar. "
"Jy kan nogsteeds gebruik die herlaai knoppie na sinkroniseer die kas met die "
"afgeleë bediener."

#: cache.cpp:117
msgid "O&ffline browsing mode"
msgstr "Af-lyn blaaiïng modus"

#: cache.cpp:120
msgid "Enable this to prevent HTTP requests by KDE applications by default."
msgstr "Aktiveer hierdie na verhoed Http versoeke deur Kde programme deur verstek."

#: cache.cpp:137
msgid "Disk cache &size:"
msgstr "Disket kas grootte:"

#: cache.cpp:145
msgid " KB"
msgstr " Kb"

#: cache.cpp:147
msgid ""
"This is the average size in KB that the cache will take on your hard disk. "
"Once in a while the oldest pages will be deleted from the cache to reduce it "
"to this size."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die gemiddelde grootte in Kb wat die kas sal neem op jou hard "
"disket. As eers in 'n terwyl die oudste bladsye sal wees uitgevee van die "
"kas na verminder dit na Hierdie grootte."

#: cache.cpp:155
msgid "C&lear Cache"
msgstr "Maak skoon Kas"

#: cache.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Click this button to completely clear the HTTP cache. This can be sometimes "
"useful to check if a wrong copy of a website has been cached, or to quickly "
"free some disk space."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na heeltemal maak skoon die Http kas. hierdie kan wees "
"party keer bruikbare na bevestig as 'n verkeerde kopie van 'n webtuiste het "
"al gekas, of na vinnig vry sommige disket spasie."

#: cache.cpp:257
msgid ""
"<h1>Cache</h1>"
"<p>This module lets you configure your cache settings.</p>"
"<p>The cache is an internal memory in Konqueror where recently read web "
"pages are stored. If you want to retrieve a web page again that you have "
"recently read, it will not be downloaded from the Internet, but rather "
"retrieved from the cache, which is a lot faster.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kas</h1>"
"<p>Hierdie module laat jy jy konfigureer jou Kas instellings.</p>"
"<p>Die Kas is 'n intern geheue in Konqueror waar onlangse lees web bladsye "
"word gestoor. As jy wil hê na onttrek 'n web bladsy weer wat jy het "
"onlangse lees, dit sal nie wees afgelaai van Die Internet, maar eerder "
"geonttrek van Die Kas, wat is 'n baie vinniger.</p>"

