#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:51
msgid "Enable coo&kies"
msgstr "Aktiveer koekies"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:52
msgid ""
"This option turns on cookie support. Normally you will want to have cookie "
"support enabled and customize it to suit your privacy needs."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie draai op koekie ondersteun. Gewoonlik jy sal wil hê na het "
"koekie ondersteun geaktiveer en pasmaak dit na pas jou privaatheid verlang."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:62
msgid "Only accept cookies from originating server"
msgstr ""

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Check this option to reject all cookies that originate from sites other than "
"the one you requested. If you, for example, visit www.foobar.com while this "
"option is checked, only cookies that come from www.foobar.com will be "
"processed per your settings. All other cookies will automatically be "
"rejected. This reduces the chances of site operators compiling a profile "
"about your daily browsing habits."
msgstr ""

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:76
msgid "Automatically accept session cookies"
msgstr "Automaties aanvaar sessie koekies"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Check this option to automatically accept temporary cookies meant to expire "
"at the end of the current session. Such cookies will not be stored in your "
"computer's hard drive or storage device. Instead, they are deleted when you "
"close all applications (e.g. your browser) that use them."
"<P>NOTE: Checking this option along with the next one will override your "
"default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends."
msgstr ""

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:93
msgid "Treat all cookies as session cookies"
msgstr "Behandel alle koekies as sessie koekies"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:97
msgid ""
"Check this option to treat all cookies as session cookies. Session cookies "
"are small pieces of data that are temporarily stored in your computer's "
"memory until you quit or close all applications (e.g. your browser) that use "
"use them. Unlike regular cookies, session cookies are never stored on your "
"hard drive or storage device."
"<P>"
"NOTE: checking this option along with the previous one will override your "
"default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie na behandel alle koekies as sessie koekies. sessie "
"koekies word klein dele van data wat word tydelik gestoor in jou rekenaar se "
"geheue totdat jy verlaat of maak toe alle programme (e.g. jou blaaier) wat "
"gebruik gebruik hulle. Ander as gewone koekies, sessie koekies word moet "
"nooit gestoor op jou hard dryf of stoorplek toestel."
"<P>Nota: toetsing hierdie opsie en met die vorige een sal oorskryf jou "
"verstek as goed as tuiste spesifieke koekie beleid. Egter, doen sodat asook "
"vermeerder jou privaatheid sedert alle koekies sal wees verwyder wanneer die "
"huidige sessie einde."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:113
msgid "Default Policy"
msgstr "Verstek Beleid"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:115
msgid ""
"The default policy determines how cookies received from a remote machine, "
"which is not associated with a specific policy (see below), will be handled: "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Ask</b>"
" will cause KDE to ask for your confirmation whenever a server wants to set "
"a cookie.</li>"
"<li><b>Accept</b> will cause cookies to be accepted without prompting "
"you.</li>"
"<li><b>Reject</b> will cause the cookiejar to refuse all cookies it "
"receives.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Die verstek beleid bepaal hoe koekies ontvang van 'n afgeleë masjien, wat "
"is nie geassosieer met 'n spesifieke beleid (sien onder), sal wees handteer: "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Vra</b> sal veroorsaak Kde na Vra vir jou bevestiging wanneer ook al "
"'n bediener wil hê na stel 'n koekie.</li>"
"<li><b>Aanvaar</b> sal veroorsaak koekies na wees aanvaar sonder om te te "
"pols jy.</li>"
"<li><b>Verwerp</b> sal veroorsaak Die koekieblik na weier alle koekies dit "
"ontvang.</li></ul>"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:126
msgid "A&sk for confirmation before accepting cookies."
msgstr "Vra vir bevestiging voor aanvaading koekies."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:130
msgid "Accep&t all cookies by default"
msgstr "Aanvaar alle koekies deur verstek"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:134
msgid "Re&ject all cookies by default"
msgstr "Verwerp alle koekies deur verstek"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:141
msgid "Domain Specific Policy"
msgstr "Domein Spesifieke Beleid"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:153
msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domein"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:160
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains for which you have set a specific cookie "
"policy. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for any "
"cookie sent by these domains. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks bevat die domein vir wat jy het stel 'n spesifieke koekie "
"beleid. Hierdie beleid sal wees gebruik word in plaas van van die verstek "
"beleid vir enige koekie gestuur deur hierdie domein. "
"<p>Kies 'n beleid en gebruik die kontroles op die regterkant na verander dit."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:171 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:101 useragentdlg.cpp:222
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "Nuwe..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:172
msgid "Add a domain specific cookie policy."
msgstr "Voeg by 'n domein spesifieke koekie beleid."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:175 useragentdlg.cpp:225
msgid "Chan&ge..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:177
msgid "Change the policy for the selected item in the list box."
msgstr "Verander die beleid vir die gekose item in die lys boks."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:184
msgid "Remove the selected policy."
msgstr "Verwyder die gekose beleid."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:189
msgid "Remove all domain policies."
msgstr "Verwyder alle domein beleid."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:193 useragentdlg.cpp:238
msgid "Import..."
msgstr "In voer..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:194
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the cookie policies. "
"These policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na kies die lêer wat bevat die koekie beleid. Hierdie "
"beleid sal wees saamgevlans met die bestaande ene. Duplikaat inskrywings "
"word geignoreer."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:200 useragentdlg.cpp:242
msgid "Export..."
msgstr "Voer uit..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:201
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the cookie policy to a zipped file. The file, "
"named <b>cookie_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na stoor die koekie beleid na 'n gezipte lêer. die "
"lêer, genaamd <b>cookie_policy.tgz</b>, sal wees gestoor na 'n ligging van "
"jou keuse."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific cookie policies for any particular domain. To add "
"a new policy, simply click on the <i>Add...</i> button and supply the "
"necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an existing "
"policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new policy from "
"the policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will remove the "
"selected policy causing the default policy setting to be used for that "
"domain. "
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel spesifieke koekie beleid vir enige spesifieke domein. Na "
"voeg deur 'n nuwe beleid, eenvoudig kliek op die <i>voeg deur...</i>"
" knoppie en verskaf die nodige informasie versoekte deur die dialoog boks. "
"Na verander 'n bestaande beleid, kliek op die <i>verander...</i> knoppie en "
"kies die nuwe beleid van die beleid dialoog boks. Te kliek op die "
"<i>Uitvee</i> knoppie sal verwyder die gekose beleid veroorsaak dat die "
"verstek beleid opset Na wees gebruik word vir wat domein. "

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:270
msgid "New Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Nuwe Koekie Beleid"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:307
msgid "Change Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Verander Koekie Beleid"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:336
msgid ""
"<qt>A policy already exists for"
"<center><b>%1</b></center>Do you want to replace it?</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>'n beleid alreeds bestaan vir"
"<center><b>%1</b></center>Doen jy wil hê na vervang dit?</qt>"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:340
msgid "Duplicate Policy"
msgstr "Duplikaat Beleid"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:623
msgid ""
"<h1>Cookies</h1> Cookies contain information that Konqueror (or any other "
"KDE application using the HTTP protocol) stores on your computer from a "
"remote Internet server. This means that a web server can store information "
"about you and your browsing activities on your machine for later use. You "
"might consider this an invasion of privacy."
"<p>However, cookies are useful in certain situations. For example, they are "
"often used by Internet shops, so you can 'put things into a shopping "
"basket'. Some sites require you have a browser that supports "
"cookies."
"<p>Because most people want a compromise between privacy and the benefits "
"cookies offer, KDE offers you the ability to customize the way it handles "
"cookies. You might, for example want to set KDE's default policy to ask you "
"whenever a server wants to set a cookie or simply reject or accept "
"everything. For example, you might choose to accept all cookies from your "
"favorite shopping web site. For this all you have to do is either browse to "
"that particular site and when you are presented with the cookie dialog box, "
"click on <i> This domain </i> under the 'apply to' tab and choose accept or "
"simply specify the name of the site in the <i> Domain Specific Policy </i> "
"tab and set it to accept. This enables you to receive cookies from trusted "
"web sites without being asked everytime KDE receives a cookie."
msgstr ""

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Variable Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Veranderlike Volmag Opstelling"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:62 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:50
msgid "Servers"
msgstr "Bedieners"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:76 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:67
msgid "H&TTP:"
msgstr "Http:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the HTTP proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Invoer die naam van die omgewing veranderlike, bv. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, "
"gebruik word na stoor die adres van die Http Volmag "
"bediener."
"<p>Alternatiwelik, jy kan kliek op die <tt>\"Outo Verklik\"</tt> knoppie na "
"poog automaties ontdekking van hierdie veranderlike.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:94 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:91
msgid "HTTP&S:"
msgstr "Https:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:101
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the HTTPS proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt an automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Invoer die naam van die omgewing veranderlike, bv. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>"
", gebruik word na stoor die adres van die Https Volmag "
"bediener."
"<p>Alternatiwelik, jy kan kliek op die <tt>\"Outo Verklik\"</tt> knoppie na "
"poog 'n automaties ontdekking van hierdie veranderlike.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:112 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:116
msgid "&FTP:"
msgstr "Ftp:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>FTP_PROXY</tt>"
", used to store the address of the FTP proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt an automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Invoer die naam van die omgewing veranderlike, bv. <tt>FTP_PROXY</tt>, "
"gebruik word na stoor die adres van die Ftp Volmag "
"bediener."
"<p>Alternatiwelik, jy kan kliek op die <tt>\"Outo Verklik\"</tt> knoppie na "
"poog 'n automaties ontdekking van hierdie veranderlike.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:139 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:150
msgid "Use same proxy server for all protocols"
msgstr "Gebruik selfde volmag bediener vir alle protokolle"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:151
msgid "&Verify"
msgstr "Bevestig"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:152
msgid ""
"<qt>Click this button to quickly determine whether or not the environment "
"variable names you supplied are valid. If an environment variable is not "
"found, the associated labels will be <b>highlighted</b> to indicate the "
"invalid settings.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Kliek hierdie knoppie na vinnig bepaal hetsy of nie die omgewing "
"veranderlike name jy verskaf word geldige. As 'n omgewing veranderlike is "
"nie gevind, die geassosieer etikette sal wees <b>verlig</b> na aandui die "
"ongeldige instellings.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:161
msgid "Auto &Detect"
msgstr "Outo Verklik"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to attempt automatic discovery of the environment "
"variables used for setting system wide proxy information."
"<p> This automatic lookup works by searching for the following common "
"variable names:</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTP: </u>%1</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTPS: </u>%2</p><p><u>For FTP: </u>%3</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Kliek op hierdie knoppie na poog automaties ontdekking van die omgewing "
"veranderlikes gebruik word vir opset stelsel wye volmag informasie."
"<p> hierdie automaties opkyk werk deur soek vir die volgende gemeenskaplike "
"veranderlike name:</p>"
"<p><u>vir Http: </u>%1</p>"
"<p><u>vir Https: </u>%2</p><p><u>vir Ftp: </u>%3</p></qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:178 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:472
msgid "Show &Values"
msgstr "Vertoon Waardes"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:185
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to see the actual values associated with the "
"environment variables.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Kliek op hierdie knoppie na sien die ware waardes geassosieer met die "
"omgewing veranderlikes.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:327 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:607
msgid "You must specify at least one valid proxy environment variable."
msgstr "Jy moet spesifiseer na minste een geldige volmag omgewing veranderlike."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:330 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:610
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure you entered the actual environment variable name rather than "
"its value. For example, if the environment variable is "
"<br><b>HTTP_PROXY=http://localhost:3128</b>"
"<br> you need to enter <b>HTTP_PROXY</b> here instead of the actual value "
"http://localhost:3128.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Maak seker jy ingevoerde die ware omgewing veranderlike naam eerder as "
"sy waarde. Vir voorbeeld, as die omgewing veranderlike is "
"<br><b>HTTP_PROXY=http://localhost:3128</b>"
"<br> jy benodig na invoer <b>HTTP_PROXY</b> hier in plaas van van die ware "
"waarde http://localhost:3128.</qt>"

