msgstr "Hand Volmag Opstelling"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:75
msgid "Enter the address of the HTTP proxy server."
msgstr "Invoer die adres van die Http volmag bediener."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:80 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:104 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:128
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Poort"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the HTTP proxy server. Default is 8080. Another "
"common value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die poort nommer van die Http volmag bediener. Verstek is 8080. Nog "
"'n gemeenskaplike waarde is 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:99
msgid "Enter the address of the HTTPS proxy server."
msgstr "Invoer die adres van die Https volmag bediener."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the secure proxy server. Default is 8080. Another "
"common value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die poort nommer van die beveilig volmag bediener. Verstek is 8080. "
"Nog 'n gemeenskaplike waarde is 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:123
msgid "Enter the address of the FTP proxy server"
msgstr "Invoer die adres van die Ftp volmag bediener"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the FTP proxy server. Default 8080. Another common "
"value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die poort nommer van die Ftp volmag bediener. Verstek 8080. Nog 'n "
"gemeenskaplike waarde is 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"This button allows you to copy the entry of one input field into all the "
"others underneath it. For example, if you fill out the information for "
"<tt>HTTP</tt> and press this button, whatever you entered will be copied to "
"all the fields below that are enabled!"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Hierdie knoppie laat toe jy na kopie die inskrywing van een invoer veld "
"binnein alle die andere onderliggend dit. Vir voorbeeld, as jy opvul uit die "
"informasie Vir <tt>Http</tt> en druk Hierdie knoppie, wat ook al jy "
"ingevoerde sal wees gekopieer na alle die velde onder wat word geaktiveer!"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:417
msgid "You must specify at least one proxy address."
msgstr "Jy moet spesifiseer na minste een volmag adres."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:419
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure that you have specified at least one or more valid proxy "
"addresses. Note that you <b>must</b> supply a fully qualified address such "
"as <b>http://192.168.20.1</b> or <b>http://proxy.foo.com</b>. All addresses "
"that do not start with a protocol (eg: http://) will be rejected as invalid "
"proxy addresses.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Maak seker wat jy het gespesifiseer na minste een of meer geldige volmag "
"adresse. Nota wat jy <b>moet</b> verskaf 'n volledig gekwalifiseer adres "
"soos as <b>http://192.168.20.1</b> of <b>http://volmag.foo.com</b>. Alle "
"adresse wat doen nie begin met 'n protokol (bv: http://) sal wees verwerp as "
"ongeldige volmag adresse.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:55
msgid "&Proxy"
msgstr "Volmag"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:56
msgid "&SOCKS"
msgstr "Socks"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:110
msgid "Use &proxy"
msgstr "Gebruik volmag"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to enable the use of proxy servers for your Internet "
"connection."
"<p>Please note that using proxy servers is optional, but has the benefit or "
"advantage of giving you faster access to data on the Internet."
"<p>If you are uncertain whether or not you need to use a proxy server to "
"connect to the Internet, consult your Internet service provider's setup "
"guide or your system administrator.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Bevestig hierdie boks na aktiveer die gebruik van volmag bedieners vir "
"jou Internet verbinding."
"<p>"
"Asseblief nota wat te gebruik volmag bedieners is opsionele, maar het die "
"voordeel van voordeel van gee jy vinniger toegang verkry na data op die "
"Internet."
"<p>"
"As jy word onseker hetsy van nie jy benodig na gebruik 'n volmag bediener na "
"konnekteer na die Internet, raadpleeg jou Internet diens provider's "
"opstelling gids van jou stelsel administrateur.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:136
msgid "Options for setting up connections to your proxy server(s)"
msgstr "Opsies vir opset begin koppelinge na jou volmag bediener(s)"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:154
msgid "A&utomatically detected script file"
msgstr "Automaties opgespoor skrip lêer"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:158
msgid ""
"<qt> Select this option if you want the proxy setup configuration script "
"file to be automatically detected and downloaded."
"<p>This option only differs from the next choice in that it <i>does not</i> "
"require you to suplly the location of the configuration script file. Instead "
"it will be automatically downloaded using the <b>Web Access Protocol "
"Discovery (WAPD)</b>."
"<p><u>NOTE:</u>"
"  If you have problem on using this setup, please consult the FAQ section at "
"http://www.konqueror.org for more information.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
" Kies hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die volmag opstelling opstelling skrip "
"lêer na wees automaties opgespoor en afgelaai."
"<p>hierdie opsie slegs verskil van die volgende keuse in wat dit <i>doen "
"nie</i> vereis jy na verskaf die ligging van die opstelling skrip lêer. In "
"plaas van dit sal wees automaties afgelaai te gebruik die <b>Web Toegang "
"verkry Protokol Ontdekking (Wapd)</b>."
"<p><u>Nota:</u>  as jy het probleem op te gebruik hierdie opstelling, "
"asseblief raadpleeg die Faq seksie na http://www.konqueror.org vir meer "
"informasie.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:179
msgid "Specified &script file"
msgstr "Gespesifiseer skrip lêer"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:181
msgid ""
"Select this option if your proxy support is provided through a script file "
"located at a specific address. You can then enter the address of the "
"location below."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jou volmag ondersteun is verskaf deur 'n skrip lêer "
"geleë na 'n spesifieke adres. Jy kan dan word invoer die adres van die "
"ligging onder."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:196
msgid "&Location:"
msgstr "Ligging:"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:220
msgid "Preset environment &variables"
msgstr "Vooraf stel omgewing veranderlikes"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:222
msgid ""
"<qt>Some systems are setup with environment variables such as "
"<b>$HTTP_PROXY</b> to allow graphical as well as non-graphical application "
"to share the same proxy configuration information."
"<p>Select this option and click on the <i>Setup...</i> button on the right "
"side to provide the environment variable names used to set the address of "
"the proxy server(s).</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Sommige sisteme word opstelling met omgewing veranderlikes soos as "
"<b>$HTTP_PROXY</b> na toelaat grafiese as goed as non-grafiese aansoek na "
"deel die selfde Volmag opstelling informasie."
"<p>Kies hierdie opsie en kliek op die <i>opstelling...</i> knoppie op die "
"regterkant kant na verskaf die omgewing veranderlike name gebruik word na "
"stel die adres van die Volmag bediener(s).</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:234 kproxydlg.cpp:250
msgid "Setup..."
msgstr "Opstelling..."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:241
msgid "&Manually specified settings"
msgstr "Eiehandig gespesifiseer instellings"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<qt>Select this option and click on the <i>Setup...</i> button on the right "
"side to manually setup the location of the proxy servers to be used.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Kies hierdie opsie en kliek op die <i>Opstelling...</i> knoppie op die "
"regterkant kant na eiehandig Opstelling die ligging van die volmag bedieners "
"na wees gebruik word.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:260
msgid "Authorization"
msgstr "Geldigheidstoets"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Setup the way that authorization information should be handled when making "
"proxy connections. The default option is to prompt you for password as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Opstelling die weg wat geldigheidstoets informasie moet wees handteer "
"wanneer maak volmag koppelinge. die verstek opsie is na por jy vir wagwoord "
"as benodig."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:283
msgid "Prompt as &needed"
msgstr "Por as benodig"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:286
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want to be prompted for the login information as "
"needed. This is default behavior."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jy wil hê na wees gepor vir die aanteken informasie "
"as benodig. hierdie is verstek gedrag."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:299
msgid "Use automatic lo&gin"
msgstr "Gebruik automaties aanteken"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:301
msgid ""
"Select this option if you have already setup a login entry for your proxy "
"server(s) in <tt>$KDEHOME/share/config/kionetrc</tt> file."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jy het alreeds opstelling 'n aanteken inskrywing vir "
"jou volmag bediener(s) in <tt>$Kde-tuiste/deel/opstelling/kionetrc</tt> "
"lêer."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:411
msgid ""
"<qt>The address of the automatic proxy configuration script is invalid! "
"Please correct this problem before proceeding. Otherwise the changes you "
"made will be ignored!</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Die adres van Die automaties volmag opstelling skrip is ongeldige! "
"Asseblief korrek hierdie probleem voor voortgaan. Andersins Die verander jy "
"gemaak sal wees geignoreer!</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:440 kproxydlg.cpp:459
msgid ""
"<qt>Proxy information was not setup properly! Please click on the "
"<em>Setup...</em> button to correct this problem before proceeding. "
"Otherwise the changes you made will be ignored!</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Volmag informasie was nie opstelling behoorlik! Asseblief kliek op die "
"<em>opstelling...</em> knoppie na korrek hierdie probleem voor voortgaan. "
"Andersins die verander jy gemaak sal wees geignoreer!</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:506
msgid ""
"<h1>Proxy</h1>"
"<p>This module lets you configure your proxy settings.</p>"
"<p>"
"A proxy is a program on another computer that receives requests from your "
"machine to access a certain web page (or other Internet resources), "
"retrieves the page and sends it back to you.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Volmag</h1>"
"<p>Hierdie module laat jy jy konfigureer jou Volmag instellings.</p>"
"<p>'n Volmag is 'n program op nog 'n rekenaar wat ontvang versoeke van jou "
"masjien na toegang verkry 'n sekere web bladsy (of ander Internet "
"hulpbronne), onttrek die bladsy en stuur dit terug na jy.</p>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the site name(s) that should be exempted from using the proxy "
"server(s) specified above."
"<p>Note that the reverse is true if the \"<code>Only use proxy for entries "
"in this list</code>\" box is checked. That is the proxy server will only be "
"used for addresses that match one of the items in this list."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Invoer die tuiste naam(s) wat moet wees uitgelaat van te gebruik die "
"volmag bediener(s) gespesifiseer boonste."
"<p>Nota wat die omgekeerde is waar as die \"<code>Slegs gebruik volmag vir "
"inskrywings in hierdie lys</code>\" boks is nagegaan. wat is die volmag "
"bediener sal Slegs wees gebruik word vir adresse wat ooreenstem een van die "
"iteme in hierdie lys."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:62
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Uitsonderings"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:72
msgid "Only use proxy for entries in this list"
msgstr "Slegs gebruik volmag vir inskrywings in hierdie lys"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to reverse the use of the exception list. i.e. Checking "
"this box will result in the proxy servers being used only when the requested "
"URL matches one of the addresses listed here."
"<p>This feature is useful if all you want or need is to use a proxy server  "
"for a few specific sites."
"<p>If you have more complex requirements you might want to use a "
"configuration script</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Bevestig hierdie boks na omgekeerde die gebruik van die uitsondering "
"lys. i.e. Toetsing hierdie boks sal resultaat in die volmag bedieners te "
"wees gebruik word slegs wanneer die versoekte Url ooreenstemmende "
"inskrywings een van die adresse gelys hier."
"<p>hierdie funksie is bruikbare as alle jy wil hê of benodig is na gebruik "
"'n volmag bediener  vir 'n paar spesifieke tuistes."
"<p>as jy het meer kompleks benodighede jy dalk wil hê na gebruik 'n "
"opstelling skrip</qt>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Click this to add an address that should be exempt from using or forced to "
"use, depending on the check box above, a proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie na voeg by 'n adres wat moet wees uitgesluit van te gebruik of "
"geforseer na gebruik, afhangend op die bevestig boks boonste, 'n volmag "
"bediener."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:107
msgid "C&hange..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:111
msgid "Click this button to change the selected exception address."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na verander die gekose uitsondering adres."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:117
msgid "Click this button to delete the selected address."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na uitvee die gekose adres."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:123
msgid "Click this button to delete all the address in the exception list."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na uitvee alle die adres in die uitsondering lys."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:135
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adres"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<qt>Contains a list of addresses that should either bypass the use of the "
"proxy server(s) specified above or use these servers based on the state of "
"the <tt>\"Only use proxy for entries in the list\"</tt> checkbox above."
"<p>If the box is checked, only URLs that match the addresses listed here "
"will be sent through the proxy server(s) shown above. Otherwise, the proxy "
"servers are bypassed for this list.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Bevat 'n lys van adresse wat moet òf ontglip die gebruik van die volmag "
"bediener(s) gespesifiseer boonste van gebruik hierdie bedieners gebaseerde "
"op die staat van die <tt>\"Slegs gebruik volmag vir inskrywings in die "
"lys\"</tt> keuseblokkie boonste."
"<p>"
"As die boks is nagegaan, Slegs Urls wat ooreenstem die adresse gelys hier "
"sal wees gestuur deur die volmag bediener(s) vertoon boonste. Andersins, die "
"volmag bedieners word ignoreer vir hierdie lys.</qt>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:165
msgid "<qt><center><b>%1</b><br/>already exists!"
msgstr "<qt><center><b>%1</b><br/>alreeds bestaan!"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:167
msgid "Duplicate Exception"
msgstr "Duplikaat Uitsondering"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:181 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:206
msgid "Enter the address or URL for which the above proxy server should be used: "
msgstr ""
"Invoer die adres of Url vir wat die boonste volmag bediener moet wees "
"gebruik word: "

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:184 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Enter the address or URL that should be excluded from using the above proxy "
"server:"
msgstr ""
"Invoer die adres of Url wat moet wees uitgesluit van te gebruik die boonste "
"volmag bediener:"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:187
msgid "New Exception"
msgstr "Nuwe Uitsondering"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:213
msgid "Change Exception"
msgstr "Verander Uitsondering"

#: ksaveioconfig.cpp:252
msgid "Update Failed"
msgstr "Dateer op Gevaal"

#: ksaveioconfig.cpp:253
msgid ""
"You have to restart the running applications for these changes to take "
"effect."
msgstr "Jy het na herbegin die wat loop programme vir hierdie verander na neem effek."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Note: kio_smb is a SMB client only. The server, if any, cannot be configured "
"from here."
msgstr ""
"Nota: kio_smb is 'n Smb kliënt slegs. Die bediener, as enige, kan nie wees "
"gekonfigureer van hier."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:37
msgid "Network Settings"
msgstr "Netwerk Instellings"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:48
msgid "&Browse server:"
msgstr "Blaai bediener:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Here you can specify the server that provides browsing information, such as "
"the list of servers."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan spesifiseer die bediener wat verskaf blaaiïng informasie, soos "
"as die lys van bedieners."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:66
msgid "Other options:"
msgstr "Ander opsies:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:71
msgid "B&roadcast address:"
msgstr "Uitsending adres:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Enter the broadcast address of your network here. Usually, this is an IP "
"address with 255 as the last of the four numbers."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die uitsending adres van jou netwerk hier. Gewoonlik, hierdie is 'n  "
"ip  adres met 255 as die laaste van die vier nommers."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:82
msgid "&WINS address:"
msgstr "Wins adres:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:89
msgid "Specify the address of the WINS server here (if any)."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die adres van die Wins bediener hier (as enige)."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:102
msgid "User Settings"
msgstr "Gebruiker Instellings"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:104
msgid ""
"In this area, you can configure which shares to access. You can also remove "
"shares that you no longer want to access or that have been revoked."
msgstr ""
"In hierdie area, jy kan konfigureer wat gedeelde bronne na toegang verkry. "
"jy kan asook verwyder gedeelde bronne wat jy nee langer wil hê na toegang "
"verkry of wat het al teruggetrek."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:122
msgid "&Server:"
msgstr "Bediener:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:130
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the server here on which you want to access a share. This "
"must be the SMB name, not the DNS name. But usually, these two are the same."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die naam van die bediener hier op wat jy wil hê na toegang verkry 'n "
"deel. Hierdie moet wees die Smb naam, nie die Dns naam. Maar gewoonlik, "
"hierdie twee word die selfde."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:134
msgid "S&hare:"
msgstr "Deel:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:142
msgid "Enter the name of the share here that you want to access."
msgstr "Invoer die naam van die deel hier wat jy wil hê na toegang verkry."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:146
msgid "&Login:"
msgstr "Aanteken:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:154
msgid "Enter your username on the SMB server here."
msgstr "Invoer jou gebruikernaam op die Smb bediener hier."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:158
msgid "&Password:"
msgstr "Wagwoord:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:167
msgid "Enter your password on the SMB server here."
msgstr "Invoer jou wagwoord op die Smb bediener hier."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:171 rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "Voeg by"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:176
msgid "Click this button to add access to a share as specified in the fields above."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na voeg by toegang verkry na 'n deel as gespesifiseer "
"in die velde boonste."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:180
msgid "Click this button to delete the currently selected share in the list."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na uitvee die huidiglik gekose deel in die lys."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:186
msgid "Known bindings:"
msgstr "Bekend bindinge:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:191
msgid ""
"This box lists the currently configured shares. You can add and delete "
"entries by using the buttons <em>Add...</em> and <em>Delete</em>"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks lyste die huidiglik gekonfigureer gedeelde bronne. Jy kan voeg "
"deur en uitvee inskrywings deur te gebruik die knoppies <em>voeg "
"deur...</em> en <em>uitvee</em>"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:203
msgid "Password Policy (while browsing)"
msgstr "Wagwoord Beleid (terwyl blaaiïng)"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:206
msgid "Add &new bindings"
msgstr "Voeg by nuwe bindinge"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:208
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want a new entry in the above list to be created "
"when a password is requested while browsing."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n nuwe inskrywing in die boonste lys na "
"wees geskep wanneer 'n wagwoord is versoekte terwyl blaaiïng."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:210
msgid "Don't s&tore new bindings"
msgstr "Moet nie stoor nuwe bindinge"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:213
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, no new entries are created in the above list "
"while browsing."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, nee nuwe inskrywings word geskep in die boonste "
"lys terwyl blaaiïng."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:378
msgid "server: "
msgstr "bediener: "

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:379
msgid "share: "
msgstr "deel: "

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:380
msgid "login: "
msgstr "aanteken: "

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:381
msgid "with password"
msgstr "met wagwoord"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:501
msgid ""
"<h1>Windows Shares</h1>Konqueror is able to access shared windows "
"filesystems if properly configured. If there is a specific computer from "
"which you want to browse, fill in the <em>Browse server</em> field. This is "
"mandatory if you do not run Samba locally. The <em>Broadcast address</em> "
"and <em>WINS address</em> fields will also be available if you use the "
"native code, or the location of the 'smb.conf' file the options are read "
"from when using Samba. In any case, the broadcast address (interfaces in "
"smb.conf) must be set up if it is guessed incorrectly or you have multiple "
"cards. A WINS server usually improves performance, and greatly reduces the "
"network load."
"<p>The bindings are used to assign a default user for a given server, "
"possibly with the corresponding password, or for accessing specific shares. "
"If you choose, new bindings will be created for logins and shares accessed "
"during browsing. You can edit all of them from here. Passwords will be "
"stored locally, and scrambled so as to render them unreadable to the human "
"eye. For security reasons you may wish not to do that, as entries with "
"passwords are clearly indicated as such.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Vensters Gedeelde bronne</h1>Konqueror is in staat na toegang verkry "
"gedeelde Vensters lêerstelsels as behoorlik gekonfigureer. as daar is 'n "
"spesifieke rekenaar van wat jy wil hê na blaai, opvul in die <em>blaai "
"bediener</em> veld. Hierdie is verpligtend as jy doen nie hardloop Samba "
"plaaslik. die <em>Uitsending adres</em> en <em>Wins adres</em> velde sal "
"asook wees beskikbaar as jy gebruik die plaaslike kode, van die ligging van "
"die 'smb.conf' lêer die opsies word lees van wanneer te gebruik Samba. in "
"enige kas, die Uitsending adres (koppelvlakke in smb.conf) moet wees stel "
"begin as dit is geraai verkeerdelik van jy het veelvuldige kaarte. 'n Wins "
"bediener gewoonlik verbeter produktiwiteit, en grootliks verminder die "
"netwerk las."
"<p>die bindinge word gebruik word na toeken 'n verstek gebruiker vir 'n "
"gegewe bediener, moontlikheid van met die ooreenstemmend wagwoord, van vir "
"toegang te kry tot spesifieke Gedeelde bronne. as jy kies, nuwe bindinge sal "
"wees geskep vir inteken en Gedeelde bronne toegang verkry gedurende "
"blaaiïng. jy kan redigeer alle van hulle van hier. Wagwoorde sal wees "
"gestoor plaaslik, en geskommel sodat as na interpreteer hulle onleesbaar na "
"die menslik oog. vir sekuriteit redes jy dalk mag wens nie na doen wat, as "
"inskrywings met Wagwoorde word duidelik aangedui as soos.<p>"

#: main.cpp:151
