msgstr "Aktiveer passief modus (Pasv)"

#: netpref.cpp:61
msgid ""
"Enables FTP's \"passive\" mode. This is required to allow FTP to work from "
"behind firewalls."
msgstr ""

#: netpref.cpp:62
msgid "Mark &partially uploaded files"
msgstr "Merk gedeeltelik opgelaaide lêers"

#: netpref.cpp:63
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Marks partially uploaded FTP files.</p>"
"<p>When this option is enabled, partially uploaded files will have a "
"\".part\" extension. This extension will be removed once the transfer is "
"complete.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Merk gedeeltelik opgelaaide Ftp lêers.</p>"
"<p>Wanneer hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, gedeeltelik opgelaaide lêers sal "
"het 'n \".deel\" uitbreiding. hierdie uitbreiding sal wees verwyder as eers "
"die oordra is volledige.</p>"

#: netpref.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<h1>Network Preferences</h1>"
"Here you can define the behavior of KDE programs when using Internet and "
"network connections. If you experience timeouts or use a modem to connect to "
"the Internet, you might want to adjust these settings."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Netwerk Voorkeure</h1>"
"Hier jy kan definieer die gedrag van Kde programme wanneer te gebruik "
"Internet en Netwerk koppelinge. As jy ervaring tyd verstreke waardes of "
"gebruik 'n modem na konnekteer na die Internet, jy dalk wil hê na verstel "
"hierdie instellings."

#: policydlg.cpp:68
msgid "Domain name:"
msgstr "Domein naam:"

#: policydlg.cpp:72
msgid ""
"Enter the host or domain to which this policy applies. E.g. "
"<i>www.kde.org</i> or <i>.kde.org</i>"
msgstr ""
"Invoer die bediener of domein na wat hierdie beleid van toepassing is. E.g. "
"<i>www.kde.org</i> of <i>.kde.org</i>"

#: policydlg.cpp:78
msgid "Policy:"
msgstr "Beleid:"

#: policydlg.cpp:81
msgid ""
"Select the desired policy:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Accept</b> - Allows this site to set cookie</li>"
"<li><b>Reject</b> - Refuse all cookies sent from this "
"site</li>"
"<li><b>Ask</b> - Prompt when cookies are received from this site</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Kies die verlangde beleid:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Aanvaar</b> - Laat toe hierdie tuiste na stel "
"koekie</li>"
"<li><b>Verwerp</b> - Weier alle koekies gestuur van hierdie "
"tuiste</li>"
"<li><b>Vra</b> - Por wanneer koekies word ontvang van hierdie "
"tuiste</li></ul>"

#: policydlg.cpp:108
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Aanvaar"

#: policydlg.cpp:109
