msgstr "Dateer op Lys"

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:65
msgid "When connecting &to the following site:"
msgstr "Wanneer maak koppeling na die volgende tuiste:"

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:69
msgid ""
"Enter the site or domain name where a fake identity should be used. "
"<p><u>NOTE:</u> Wildcard syntax such as \"*,?\" is NOT allowed. Instead "
"enter the top level address of a site to make generic matches for all "
"locations found under it. For example, if you want all sites at "
"<code>http://www.acme.com</code> to receive fake browser-identification, "
"simply enter <code>acme.com</code> here."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die tuiste van domein naam waar 'n nagemaakte identiteit moet wees "
"gebruik word. "
"<p><u>Nota:</u> Willekeurige karakter sintaks soos as \"*,?\" is Nie "
"toegelaat. In plaas van Invoer die bo vlak adres van 'n tuiste na maak "
"generies ooreenstemmende inskrywings vir alle liggings gevind onder dit. vir "
"voorbeeld, as jy wil hê alle tuistes na <code>http://www.acme.com</code>"
" na ontvang nagemaakte browser-identification, eenvoudig Invoer "
"<code>acme.com</code> hier."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:78
msgid "Use the following &identity:"
msgstr "Gebruik die volgende identiteit:"

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"Select the browser-identification to use whenever contacting the site or "
"domain given above."
"<P>Upon selection, a straight forward description, if available, will be "
"displayed in the box below."
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Kies die browser-identification na gebruik wanneer ook al kontak maak na die "
"tuiste of domein gegewe boonste."
"<P>"
"Van keuse, 'n reguit vorentoe beskrywing, as beskikbaar, sal wees vertoon in "
"die boks onder."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:91
msgid "Alias (description):"
msgstr "Skuilnaam (beskrywing):"

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:95
msgid "A plain (friendlier) description of the above browser-identification string."
msgstr ""
"'n eenvoudig (vriendeliker) beskrywing van die boonste "
"browser-identification string."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:101
msgid ""
"Updates the browser identification list shown above.<p>\n"
"<u>NOTE:</u> There is no need to press this button unless a new "
"browser-identfication description file was added after this configuration "
"box was already displayed!"
msgstr ""
"Opdateer die blaaier identifikasie lys vertoon boonste.<p>\n"
"<u>Nota:</u> Daar is nee benodig na druk hierdie knoppie tensy 'n nuwe "
"blaaier-identfication beskrywing lêer was bygevoeg na hierdie opstelling "
"boks was alreeds vertoon!"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:57
msgid "Send browser &identification"
msgstr "Stuur blaaier identifikasie"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<qt>If unchecked, no identification information about your browser will be "
"sent to sites you visit while browsing."
"<P><u>NOTE:</u> Many sites rely on this information to display pages "
"properly, hence, it is highly recommended that you do not totaly disable "
"this feature but rather customize it."
"<P>Only minimal identification information is sent to remote sites as shown "
"below in <b>bold</b>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>as onbevestig, nee identifikasie informasie aangaande jou blaaier sal "
"wees gestuur na tuistes jy besoek terwyl blaaiïng."
"<P><u>Nota:</u> Veel tuistes maak staat op hierdie informasie na vertoon "
"bladsye behoorlik, dus, dit is hoog aanbeveel wat jy doen nie heeltemal "
"deaktiveer hierdie funksie maar eerder pasmaak dit."
"<P>Slegs minimum identifikasie informasie is gestuur na afgeleë tuistes as "
"vertoon onder in <b>vetdruk</b>.</qt>"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:77
msgid "Customize Default Identification"
msgstr "Pasmaak Verstek Identifikasie"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Check any one of the following boxes to modify the level of information that "
"should be included in the default browser identification shown above in "
"<b>bold</b>."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig enige een van die volgende bokse na verander die vlak van "
"informasie wat moet wees ingesluite in die verstek blaaier identifikasie "
"vertoon boonste in <b>vetdruk</b>."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:100
msgid ""
"This is the default identification sent to remote sites during browsing. You "
"can modify it using the checkboxes below."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die verstek identifikasie gestuur na afgeleë tuistes gedurende "
"blaaiïng. Jy kan verander dit te gebruik die merkboksies onder."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:110
msgid "Add operating s&ystem name"
msgstr "Voeg by operating stelsel naam"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>operating system name</code>"
" to the default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na voeg by jou <code>operating stelsel naam</code> na "
"die verstek identifikasie string."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:124
msgid "Add operating system &version"
msgstr "Voeg by operating stelsel weergawe"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:126
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>operating system version number</code> to "
"the default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na voeg by jou <code>operating stelsel weergawe "
"nommer</code> na die verstek identifikasie string."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:139
msgid "Add &platform name"
msgstr "Voeg by platvorm naam"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>platform</code> to the default "
"identification string."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na voeg by jou <code>platvorm</code> na die verstek "
"identifikasie string."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:154
msgid "Add &machine (processor) type"
msgstr "Voeg by masjien (verwerker) tipe"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:155
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>machine or processor type</code> to the "
"default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na voeg by jou <code>masjien of verwerker tipe</code> "
"na die verstek identifikasie string."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:168
msgid "Add yo&ur language setting"
msgstr "Voeg by jou taal opset"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:169
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your language settings to the default identification "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie boks na voeg by jou taal instellings na die verstek "
"identifikasie string."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:181
msgid "Site/Domain Specific Identification"
msgstr "Tuiste/Domein Spesifieke Identifikasie"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:193
msgid "Site/Domain Name"
msgstr "Tuiste/Domein Naam"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:194
msgid "User Agent"
msgstr "Gebruiker Agent"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:195
msgid "Alias"
msgstr "Skuilnaam"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:210
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"This box contains a list of browser-identifications that will be used in "
"place of the default one when browsing the listed site(s)."
"<P>These site-specific bindings enable any browser that uses this "
"information to change its identity when you visit the associated site."
"<P>Use the buttons on the right to add a new site-specific identifier or to "
"change and/or delete an existing one.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Hierdie boks bevat 'n lys van blaaier-identifications wat sal wees "
"gebruik word in plek van die verstek een wanneer blaaiïng die gelys "
"tuiste(s)."
"<P>Hierdie tuiste-specific bindinge aktiveer enige blaaier wat gebruik "
"Hierdie informasie na verander sy identiteit wanneer jy besoek die "
"geassosieer tuiste."
"<P>"
"Gebruik die knoppies op die regterkant na voeg by 'n nuwe tuiste-specific "
"identifiseerder of na verander en/of uitvee 'n bestaande een.</qt>"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:223
msgid "Add browser identification for a specific site."
msgstr "Voeg by blaaier identifikasie vir 'n spesifieke tuiste."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:227
msgid "Change the selected identifier."
msgstr "Verander die gekose identifiseerder."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:231
